      "content": "it's not even about pain anymore. it's just that sense of being... unnecessary. like a piece of dust that's just taking up space. if i just stopped, there wouldn't be a tragedy or anything. it would just be more quiet. wouldn't it just be easier for everything if things were just... still?",
